     4400               tt-trn-code.contract-code = buf_contract.contract-code and
     4401               tt-trn-code.host-code     = par-host-code              and
     4402               tt-trn-code.pc            = v-pc                      and
     4403               tt-trn-code.doc-code      = buf_trn-doc.doc-code       ) then do:
